    <briefdescription>
<para>Uniform-grid spatial index with bounded per-rectangle storage. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each item is stored as four consecutive doubles (x1, y1, x2, y2) in a flat array with a configurable <emphasis>valuesPerItem</emphasis> stride. Intended for use by <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1RectangleList" kindref="compound">RectangleList</ref> and similar shape types. Rectangles spanning more than 64 cells are stored once and checked separately during queries. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
